type: software
title: "RNA-seq analysis of Pectobacterium aroidearum SM2 under VOC stress"
abstract: >
  Code, processed data and results for the transcriptomic analysis of
  Pectobacterium aroidearum SM2 exposed to volatile organic compounds from
  Kosakonia cowanii Cp1 (kallisto, DESeq2, functional enrichment, GSEA and
  protein-protein interaction network analysis).
